OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 119 Sat 21 NovC05:18/17
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz   
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AIn a year of AI solving maths problems,
OL,4,AAnthropic may have just solved the     
OL,5,Abiggest                                
OL,7,FIf found to be correct, the proof would
OL,8,Fbe among the most significant in       
OL,9,Fhistory. Alpoge described it as "one   
OL,10,Fdawn across science of something far   
OL,11,Fgreater".                              
OL,13,FThe claim comes as AI firms like OpenAI
OL,14,Fhave in recent months announced scores 
OL,15,Fof solutions to major higher maths     
OL,16,Fproblems that have eluded scholars for 
OL,17,Fdecades.                               
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
